flowchart TB
    App["应用程序／后端"] -->|"MQTT 或已签署 HTTP"| Shadow["影子状态服务"]
    Shadow <-->|"GET、desired、reported"| Device["设备固件"]
    Device --> Broker["MQTT Broker"]
    Device --> WS["设备 WebSocket 端点"]
    Broker -->|"SDK owner 协议"| Owner["唯一有效的 owner 传输连接"]
    WS -->|"优先顺序较高"| Owner
    Command["支持的设备命令路由"] --> Owner
    Owner -->|"只送往当前 owner"| Device
    Observer["只操作影子的教学客户端"] --> Broker
    Observer -.->|"不创建 owner 生命周期"| Owner
